# Native App Standardization

- Branch: `candidate/webapp-native-app-v2`
- Goal: native iOS/Android feel for the whole PWA except Market
- Roadmap: `docs/uiux-native-app-v2/ROADMAP.md`
- Language: `docs/uiux-native-app-v2/LANGUAGE.md`
- Messenger frontend restyle is fully allowed
- Do not edit `/market` or `home-market-widget`. Chrome of AdminMessages/TradingSettings/Jalali may restyle; keep calendar confirm and market interiors.
- Fields: `--ds-control-*` or `AppInput` / `AppSelect` / `AppTextarea` / `AppSearchField`
- Lists: `AppInsetGroup` + grouped `AppListItem`; 16px page gutter; no edge-flush cards
- Touch target: 48px; button text stays inside the control; no `--ui-v2-*` in new product CSS
- Messenger behavior stays legacy-default; albums only via `album_id` + `album_index`
- No push, merge, or deploy unless the user asks
